    "detailed_description": "Illumina Girls is an exhilarating 3D block breaking game with a new sensation.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe controls are very simple. press right cursor key to move the player to the right, press left cursor key to move the player to the left, and that's it!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe level is cleared when all the blocks are broken by hitting back the bouncing ball!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf the ball reaches the bottom of the stage, the player will be damaged.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCalculate the player's position and fine-tune the angle at which the ball is hit back.",
